        "rich_text": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": {
              "content": "Build a single-page interactive \"사다리타기\" (ghost-leg / amidakuji) web app\nas one self-contained HTML file (vanilla HTML/CSS/JS, no libraries).\n\nRequirements:\n- 2 to 8 participants; editable participant names and result labels\n- A button to randomly generate the ladder rungs each time\n- Click a participant to animate a colored line tracing down the ladder to its result\n- Show the matched \"name -> result\" pairs; add a \"reveal all\" button\n- Clean flat dark UI, mobile responsive, Korean text, no emoji",
              "link": null
            },
            "annotations": {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false,
              "code": false,
              "color": "default"
            },
            "plain_text": "Build a single-page interactive \"사다리타기\" (ghost-leg / amidakuji) web app\nas one self-contained HTML file (vanilla HTML/CSS/JS, no libraries).\n\nRequirements:\n- 2 to 8 participants; editable participant names and result labels\n- A button to randomly generate the ladder rungs each time\n- Click a participant to animate a colored line tracing down the ladder to its result\n- Show the matched \"name -> result\" pairs; add a \"reveal all\" button\n- Clean flat dark UI, mobile responsive, Korean text, no emoji",
            "href": null
          }
        ],
        "language": "plain text"
      },
      "archived": false,
      "children": []
